  "title": "GE HealthCare introduces MIM Anyware to extend remote access to imaging data and optimize clinical collaboration",
  "summary": "MIM Anyware is designed to deliver secure, healthcare system-controlled access to the full portfolio of GE HealthCare’s MIM software solutions through a web browser, regardless of their location. The platform enables simultaneous clinical review and processing of imaging data across departments to enhance clinical collaboration and patient care delivery.",
